Third-party notices for traqilet.

The crates below are linked into traqilet and used under the licences shown. A licence
appears once per distinct text, since MIT and its kin carry their copyright line inside
the licence itself and one crate's is not another's.

This file is generated, not written. Regenerate it whenever a dependency changes:

    cargo install cargo-about --features cli   # once; the binary needs that feature
    cargo xtask build                          # cranelift has to be on disk to resolve
    cargo about generate about.hbs | fold -s -w 100 | sed 's/[[:space:]]*$//' >THIRD-PARTY.txt

The fold is there because a few crates ship their licence as one line per paragraph, one
of them 952 characters wide. It only splits lines already past the width, so text that
came wrapped stays as its author wrapped it.

Which licences are acceptable, and which one is elected where a crate offers a choice,
is set in about.toml. The shape of this file is set in about.hbs. Edit those, not this.

